        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Émile Verdet\n- Organizations: Annales de chimie et de physique\n- Concepts: conservation of energy\n- Places: Paris, France\n\nFacts:\n- Annales de chimie et de physique was founded in Paris, France, in 1789 under the title Annales de chimie.\n- Marcel Émile Verdet was born on 13 March 1824 and was a French physicist.\n- Émile Verdet championed the early theory of the conservation of energy in France through his editorial supervision of Annales de chimie et de physique.\n- Marcel Émile Verdet died on 3 June 1866.",
